    "sys": {
      "x": -560,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 440,
      "text": "System — Graphite Studio v2\n\nGround #0A0B0D, panels #14171B / #1A1E23, hairlines #252A31. Accent teal #2BD4B0. Light theme: same layout on light surfaces; switch in the top bar.\n\nType (system UI font: Segoe UI on Windows; weights 400/500/600, like Resolve and Filmora): page title 16/24 600 · section 14/20 500 · panel 13/20 500 · body 13/20 400 · small 12/18 muted · label 13/20 400 muted, sentence case · table header 12/16 400 muted, no caps · button 13/20 400 (primary 500) · metric 20/28 500 tabular · timecode 13/16 400 tabular.\n\nTop bar: context · search · live token counter (spendable, from GET /v1/wallet; 5 s while jobs run) · light/dark switch · Jobs Center · notifications · shortcuts · account.\n\nNav: left rail 240px, collapses to 64px icons (Ctrl/Cmd+B), choice remembered. Guided hides Tactical, Clip Studio, Admin.\n\nReal data only. Honest states: Licence Not verified · Engine accuracy Not measured · Models: none registered.",
      "fill": "gray",
      "size": "s"
    },
